{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"帝官天下，王者家焉。至於親九族，敬五宗，其揆一也。三代以上，封建久長，故吳、魯、燕、蔡、衛、晉、鄭，太史遷既著世家，又列年表，不厭其詳。自漢以降，封建實亡，猶有其名，長世者登世家，自絕者置列傳，然王子侯猶可以年表也。班固以為文無實，併諸侯削年而表，世君子韙之。自魏以降，不帝不世，王侯身徙數封，朝不謀夕，於是列而傳之。功不足以垂法，罪不足以著戒，碌碌然，抑又甚焉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"今摘其功罪傑然者列諸傳；敘親親之恩，敬長之義，而無他可書者，略表見之，為皇子表。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"帝系","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"名字","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第行","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"封爵","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"官職","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"薨壽","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"子孫","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"肅祖四子：昭烈皇后蕭氏生，懿祖第二，見帝紀。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"洽慎，字牙新。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第一。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"迭剌部夷離菫。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"有德行。分五石烈為七，六爪為十一。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"房在五院司。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"葛剌，字古昆。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第三。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"舍利。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"早卒。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"房在六院司。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"洽禮，字敵輦。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第四。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"舍利。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"房在六院司。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"懿祖四子：莊敬皇后蕭氏生，玄祖第三，見帝紀。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"叔剌。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第一。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"舍利。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"早卒。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"帖剌，字痕得。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第二。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"九任迭剌部夷離菫。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"卒年七十。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"六院司，呼為九離菫房。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"褭古直，字巖母根。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第四。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"舍利。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"善射。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"年幾冠，墮馬卒。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"六院司，呼為舍利房。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"玄祖四子：簡獻皇后蕭氏生，德祖第四，見帝紀。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"麻魯。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第一。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"舍利。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"早卒。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"巖木，字敵輦。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第二。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"重熙中，追封蜀國王。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"三為迭剌部夷離菫。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"身長八尺，多力，能裂○皮。語音如鐘，彌里本嶺去家數里，嘗登嶺呼其從，家人悉聞之。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"年四十五薨。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"二子：胡古只，末掇。其後即三父房之孟父。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"釋魯，字述瀾。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第三。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"重熙中，追封為隋國王。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"于越。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"駢脅多力，賢而有智。先遙輦氏可汗歲貢于突厥，至釋魯為于越始免。教民種樹桑麻。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"年五十七，為子滑哥所弒。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"子滑哥。其後即三父房之仲父。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"德祖六子：宣簡皇后蕭氏生五子，太祖第一，見帝紀。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"剌葛，字率懶。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第二","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"太祖即位，為惕隱，改迭剌部夷離菫。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"為愓隱，討涅烈部，破之，改為迭剌部夷離菫。從太祖親征，統本部兵攻下平州。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"性愚險。破涅烈部而驕，與弟迭剌、安端等謀亂。事覺，按問，具伏，太祖令誓而舍之。太祖曰：「汝謀此事，不過欲富貴爾。」出為迭剌部夷離菫。復謀為亂，誘群弟據西山以阻歸路，太祖聞而避之，次赤水城。剌葛詐降，復使神速焚明王樓，大掠而去。至擘只、喝只二河，與追兵戰，眾潰。及鴨里河，女骨部人邀擊之，剌葛輕騎遁去。至榆河，先鋒敵魯生擒之。太祖念其同氣，不忍加刑，杖而釋之。神冊二年，南奔。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"自幽州南竄，為人所殺。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"子賽保。即三父房之季父。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"迭剌，字雲獨昆。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第三。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"天顯元年，為中臺省左大相。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"性敏給。太祖曰「迭剌之智，卒然圖功，吾所不及；緩以謀事，不如我。」回鶻使至，無能通其語者，太後謂太祖曰：「迭剌聦敏可使。」遣迓之。相從二旬，能習其言與書，因制契丹小字，數少而該貫。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"與兄剌葛謀反，剌葛遁，迭剌與安端降，太祖杖而釋之。神冊三年，欲南奔，事覺，親戚請免於上，又赦之。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"寅底石，字阿辛。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第四。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"重熙間，追封許國王。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"太祖遺詔寅底石守太師、政事令，輔東丹王。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"生而闇懦。與兄剌葛作亂，兵敗，太祖赦之。後復與剌葛遁至榆河，自刺不死，被擒，太祖釋之。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"太祖命輔東丹王，淳欽皇后遣司徒劃沙殺於路。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"孫阿烈。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"安端，字猥隱","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第五。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"天祿初，以功王東丹國，賜號明王。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"神冊三年，為惕隱。天顯四年，為北院夷離菫。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"神冊三年，討平雲州。天顯元年，征渤海，破老相兵三萬餘人；安邊、鄚頡、定理三府叛，平之。太宗即位，有定策功，會同中，伐晉，率兵先出雁門，下忻、代。世宗初立，以兵往應，及李胡戰於泰德泉，敗之。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"與兄剌葛謀亂，妻粘睦姑告變，太祖誓而免之。復叛，兵敗，見擒，杖而釋之。子察割弒逆被誅，穆宗赦通謀罪，放歸田里。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"蘇，字獨昆。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第六。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"神冊五年，為惕隱。六年，為南府宰相。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"言無隱情，太祖尤愛之。滄州節度使劉守文求救，太祖命往救，解滄州圍。剌葛詐降，蘇往來其間。既平，蘇力為多。天贊三年，與迭里略地西南。天顯初，征渤海，攻破忽汗城，大諲譔降。性柔順，事上忠謹。太祖二十功臣，蘇居其一。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"在南府，以賄聞，民頗怨。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"征渤海國還，薨。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"已上並係季父房。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"太祖四子：淳欽皇后蕭氏生三子，太宗第二，見帝紀。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"倍，小字圖欲，唐明宗賜姓東丹，名慕華，改賜姓李，名贊華。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第一。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"神冊元年，立為皇太子。天顯元年，為東丹國人皇王，建元甘露，稱制行事，置左右大相及百官，一用漢法。太宗立詔居東平郡，升為南京。太宗諡曰文武元皇王。世宗諡讓國皇帝。統和中，更諡文獻皇帝。重熙二十一年，增諡文獻欽義皇帝。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"唐遣人來招，倍浮海奔唐，唐人迎以天子儀衛改瑞州為懷化軍，拜懷化軍節度使，瑞、慎等州觀察使。移鎮滑州。召入，遙領虔州節度使。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"聦敏好學，通陰陽、醫藥、箴灸之術，知音律，善畫，工文章。太祖征烏古、党項，倍為先鋒都統。經略燕地，至定州。聞太祖與李存勗相拒於雲碧店，引兵馳赴，存勗退走。陳渤海可取之計。天顯元年，從征渤海，拔扶餘城，太祖欲括戶口，諫止，且勸乘勢攻忽汗城，夜圍降之。唐李從珂自立，密報太宗曰「從珂弒君，不可不討。」","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"外寬內忍，刻急，喜殺人。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"唐主從珂將自焚，遣壯士李彥紳害之，薨年三十八，葬醫巫閭山。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"子婁國、隆先、道隱。已下並係橫帳。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"李胡，一名洪古，字奚隱。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第三。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_104","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"天顯五年，立為皇太弟。統和中，追諡欽順皇帝。重熙二十一年，更諡章肅皇帝。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_105","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"天顯五年，兼天下兵馬大元帥。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_106","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"勇悍多力。天顯五年，徇代北，攻寰州，多俘而還。太宗凡親征，常留守京師。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_107","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"性酷忍，小怒，輒黥人面，或投水火中。世宗即位於鎮陽，太后怒，遣李胡將兵往擊，至泰德泉，為安端、劉哥所敗。耶律屋質諫太后，李胡作色曰：「我在，兀欲安得立？」屋質曰：「民心畏公酷暴，無如之何！」太后曰：「我與太祖愛汝異於諸子。諺曰：『偏憐之子不保業，難得之婦不主家。』我非不欲立汝，汝自不能矣。」李胡往世宗軍議和，解而後見。和約定，趨上京。有告李胡與太后謀廢立，徙祖州。穆宗時，喜隱反，辭連李胡，囚之。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_108","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"死於囚所，年五十，葬玉峰山西谷。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_109","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"二子：宋王喜隱、衛王宛。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_110","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"宮人蕭氏生一子。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_111","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"牙里果，字敵輦。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_112","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第四。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_113","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"自晉還，始為惕隱。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_114","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"性沉默，善騎射。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_115","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"天顯三年，救耶律沙於定州，為李嗣源所獲，至石晉立，始得還。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_116","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"以病薨。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_117","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"二子：敵烈、奚底，皆知名。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_118","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"太宗五子：靖安皇后蕭氏生二子，穆宗第一，見帝紀。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_119","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"罨撤葛。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_120","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第二。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_121","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"會同元年，封太平王。世宗詔許與晉主往復以昆弟禮。景宗封齊王，贈皇太叔，諡欽靖。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_122","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"穆宗委以國政。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_123","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"謀亂，令司天魏璘卜日，覺，貶西北邊戍。景宗即位，撒葛懼，竄於大漠，召還，釋其罪。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_124","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"保寧四年，病疽薨。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_125","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"宮人蕭氏生三子。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_126","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"天德，字苾扇。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_127","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第三。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_128","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"猛悍趫捷，人望而畏。太宗討石重貴，至望都，晉將杜重威率兵十萬先據河梁。上欲以計破之，募能斷糧道者，天德請以五千騎行。許之。從間道擊走衛送之軍，火其輜重。重威窮蹙，乃降。會同三年，與邸用和使晉。世宗即位，遣天德護送太宗靈柩於上京。太后遣李胡拒世宗，遇耶律留哥等於泰德泉，戰甚力，敗之。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_129","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"與李胡戰於泰德泉，太后聞之不悅，後不復用。與侍衛蕭翰謀反，繫獄。耶律留哥、盆都等辭連天德，併按之。天德斷鎖，不能出。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_130","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"天祿二年，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_131","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"敵烈，字巴速菫。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_132","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第四。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_133","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"保寧初，封冀王。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_134","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"多力善射。保寧初，宋人侵漢，與南府宰相耶律沙將兵往援，卻敵而還。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_135","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"與宣徽使耶律海思等謀反，事覺，穆宗釋之。乾亨初，宋主攻河東，至白馬嶺，敵烈以先鋒度澗，未半，宋軍逆繫，師潰。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_136","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"歿於陣。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_137","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"子哇哥，白馬嶺之敗俱歿。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_138","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"必攝，字箴菫。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_139","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第五。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_140","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"景宗封為越王。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_141","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"應曆間，族人恆特及蕭啜里有罪，欲亡，必攝密以聞。上以為忠，常以侍從。上好畜鹿，有傷斃及逸去，即殺主者。適欲誅一監養鹿官，必攝諫而免。景宗時，討党項有功。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_142","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"以疾薨。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_143","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"世宗三子：景宗第二。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_144","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"吼阿不。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_145","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第一。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_146","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"舊史皇族傳書在第三，且云未詳所出。按景宗本紀云，景宗皇帝，世宗第二子。又按舊史本傳云，景宗立，親祭於墓，追冊為皇太子。當是世宗嫡長子也。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_147","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"景宗立，追冊為皇太子，諡莊聖。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_148","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"早薨。墓號太子院。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_149","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"妃甄氏生一子。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_150","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"只沒，字和魯菫。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_151","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第三。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_152","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"舊史皇族傳書在第一。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_153","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"景宗封為寧王，保寧八年奪爵。統和元年，皇太后稱制，詔復舊爵。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_154","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"敏給好學，通契丹、漢字，能詩。統和元年，應皇太后命，賦移芍藥詩。","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_155","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"應曆末，與宮人私通，上聞，怒，榜掠數百，刺一目而宮之，繫獄，將棄市。景宗即位，釋之，賜以所私宮人。保寧八年，妻造鴆毒，奪爵，貶烏古部。賦放鶴詩，徵還。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_156","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"景宗四子：睿智皇后蕭氏生三子，聖宗第一，見帝紀。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_157","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"隆慶，字燕隱，小字普賢奴。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_158","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第二。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_159","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"八歲封恆王。統和十六年，徙王梁國。開泰初，更王晉國，進王秦晉，追贈皇太弟。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_160","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"初兼侍中。統和中，拜南京留守。開泰初，加守太師，兼政事令，尋拜大元帥，賜金券。","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_161","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"統和十七年南征，為先鋒，至瀛州，遇宋將范庭召列陣以待。隆慶遣蕭柳擊敗之，逃入空墅，圍而盡殪。十九年，復敗宋人於行唐。","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_162","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"入覲，還至北安州，浴溫泉，疾薨，葬醫巫閭山。","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_163","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"子五人：查葛、遂哥、謝家奴、驢糞、蘇撒。","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_164","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"隆祐，小字高七，一字胡都菫。","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_165","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第三。","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_166","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"乾享初，封鄭王。統和中，徙王吳，更王楚。開泰初，改王齊。諡仁孝。重熙間，改諡孝靖。","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_167","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"統和中伐宋，留守京師，拜西南面招討使。及征高麗，復留守京師，權知北院樞密使。出守東京。贈守太師。","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_168","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"開泰元年薨。","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_169","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"子三人：胡都古、合祿、貼不。","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_170","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"一子不詳所出。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_171","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"藥師奴。","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_172","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第四。","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_173","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"早卒，葬王子院。","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_174","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"聖宗六子：欽哀皇后蕭氏生二子，興宗第一，見帝紀。","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_175","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"重元，小字孛吉只。","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_176","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第二。","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_177","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"太平三年，封秦國王。興宗立為皇太弟，賜金券。道宗冊為皇太叔，免拜，不名，復賜金券。","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_178","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"歷南、北院樞密使，南京留守，知元帥府事。道宗拜天下兵馬大元帥。","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_179","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"聖宗崩，欽哀皇后稱制，密謀立重元，重元以所謀白於上，上益重之。後雖處戎職，未嘗離輦下，尊寵古未之有。","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_180","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"清寧九年，車駕秋獵灤水，重元子涅魯古與陳六、蕭胡睹等四百餘人謀反，誘脅弩手軍攻行宮。將戰，其黨多悔過效順，各奔潰。重元奔走大漠，歎曰：「涅魯古使我至此。」","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_181","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"謀反，軍潰，自殺。","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_182","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"子涅魯古謀反，戰歿。","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_183","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"一子未詳所出。","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_184","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"別古特，字撒懶。","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_185","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第三。","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_186","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"重熙中，封柳城郡王。","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_187","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"太平七年，遙領彰信軍節度使，為王子郎君班詳穩。重熙中，累遷契丹行宮都部署。","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_188","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"明敏，善射。討夏國，督戰有功。","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_189","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"討夏軍還，薨。","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_190","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"僕隗氏生二子。","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_191","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"吳哥，字洪隱。","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_192","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第四。","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_193","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"燕王。","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_194","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"開泰二年，為惕隱，出為南京留守。","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_195","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"薨於南京。","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_196","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"四世孫敵烈、朮烈。朮烈繼梁王雅里稱帝。","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_197","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"狗兒，字屠魯昆。","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_198","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第五。","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_199","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"太平元年，拜南府宰相。","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_200","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"暴疾薨。","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_201","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"姜氏生一子。","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_202","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"侯古，字訛里本。","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_203","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第六。","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_204","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"重熙十七年，封饒樂郡王。咸雍中，徙混同郡王。","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_205","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"重熙初，王子郎君班詳穩，後為上京留守。","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_206","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"薨於上京。","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_207","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"興宗三子：仁懿皇后蕭氏生三子，道宗第一，見帝紀。","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_208","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"和魯斡，字阿輦。","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_209","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第二。","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_210","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"重熙十七年，封越王。清寧初，徙王魯，進王宋魏。乾統三年，冊為皇太叔。","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_211","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"清寧中，拜上京留守，改南京留守。乾統初，為天下兵馬大元帥，加守太師，免拜，不名。三年，為惕隱，加義和仁壽之號，復守南京。","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_212","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"重元亂，和魯斡夜赴戰。","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_213","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"天祚即位，弛圍場之禁。和魯斡請曰「天子以巡幸為大事，雖居諒陰，不可廢也。」上以為然，覆命有司促備春水之行。","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_214","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"從獵於慶州，薨。","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_215","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"子三人：石篤、遠、淳。淳封秦晉王，稱帝。","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_216","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"阿璉，字訛里本。","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_217","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第三。","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_218","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"重熙十七年，封許王。清寧初，徙陳王、秦王，進封秦越國。追封秦魏國王，諡欽正。","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_219","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"清寧中，出為遼興軍節度使。咸雍間，歷西京、上京留守。","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_220","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"從車駕秋獵，以疾薨。","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_221","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"道宗一子：宣懿皇后蕭氏生。","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_222","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"濬，小字耶魯斡。","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_223","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第一。","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_224","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"六歲封梁王，八歲立為皇太子，諡昭懷，以天子禮葬。乾統初，追尊大孝順聖皇帝，廟號順宗。","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_225","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"大康元年，兼領北、南院樞密使。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_226","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"幼能言，好學，知書。文帝屢曰：「此子聦慧，殆天授。」七歲從獵，連中二鹿，上謂左右曰：「祖先騎射絕人，威振天下，是兒雖幼，當不墜祖風。」後復遇十鹿，射之，得九，帝喜，為設宴。","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_227","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"年二十，為乙辛誣害，囚上京，見殺，葬玉峰山。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_228","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"子天祚皇帝，諱延禧。","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_229","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"天祚六子：文妃生一子。","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_230","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"敖魯斡。","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_231","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第一。","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_232","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"出繼大丞相耶律隆運後。","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_233","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"初封晉王。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_234","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"喜揚人善，勸其不能，中外稱其長者。","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_235","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"保大元年，南軍都統耶律余睹以敖盧斡有人望，與文妃密謀立之，不果，余睹降金，文妃伏誅，敖盧斡不與謀，得免。耶律撒八等復謀立敖盧斡，事覺，或勸之亡，曰「安忍為蕞爾之軀，失臣子之節！」聞者傷之。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_236","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"保大二年，以得人心縊死。","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_237","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"元妃生一子。","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_238","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"雅里，字撒鸞。","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_239","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第二。","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_240","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"七歲，欲立為太子，別置禁衛，封梁王。天祚奔夏，眾推稱帝，改元神曆。","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_241","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"四子未詳所出。","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_242","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"撻魯。","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_243","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第三。","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_244","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"燕國王。","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_245","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"早薨。","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_246","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"習泥烈。","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_247","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第四","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_248","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"趙王。","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_249","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"從天祚至白水濼，為金師所獲。","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_250","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"定。","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_251","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第五。","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_252","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"秦王。","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_253","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"至青塚濼，為金師所獲。","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_254","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"寧。","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_255","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"第六。","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_256","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"許王。","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_64_257","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_64","textTraditional":"至青塚濼，為金師所獲。","sentenceOrder":257}],"overrides":{}}